        <briefdescription>
<para>Callable type for a custom quantics reshape encoding backend. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When installed via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_hiss_reshaper_1a232a13132a36528b668344a5c624e934" kindref="member">setQuanticsFn()</ref></computeroutput>, the callable is invoked instead of the built-in pure-binary padded-QTT path. The callable MUST:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>satisfy the same size/product contracts as <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_hiss_reshaper_1a3b8d787f17f79ffa0f66490220f7ca2e" kindref="member">exposeQuantics()</ref></computeroutput>, and</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>populate <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_train_1a14f3deee4e863572c0a18af8f53dd5bc" kindref="member">QTTrain::mapping</ref></computeroutput> if the caller needs reversible index mapping (the built-in path always populates it).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>train</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input TT train. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>grid_sizes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Physical dimension sizes (may be empty → use mode_sizes). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_q_t_train" kindref="compound">QTTrain</ref> in the quantics layout. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
